  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a griddle or tava to medium heat.",
    "In a bowl, mix natto with tomato paste, garlic powder, red pepper flakes, and olive oil until well combined.",
    "Spread the mixture evenly on the preheated griddle. Cook for about 5 minutes on each side or until golden brown.",
    "Garnish with grated parmesan cheese and chopped basil leaves. Serve hot as a quick lunch dish.",
    "Optional: Toss any leftover natto mix in olive oil and bake at 180°C for another 2-3 minutes to make crispy nuggets."
